---
/**
 * Soft cream backdrop shape — the large quarter-circle that bleeds off the
 * top-left of the sub-site pages (Figma "Kittens" frame). Purely decorative:
 * absolutely positioned behind content, ignored by assistive tech.
 *
 * Place inside a `relative` container; content should sit in a higher stacking
 * context (it renders at z-0 with negative-ish offsets so it tucks behind the
 * page padding without introducing horizontal scroll).
 */
---

<div
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="pointer-events-none absolute top-0 left-0 -z-0 overflow-hidden"
  style="width:min(58vw,640px);height:min(58vw,640px);max-height:560px;"
>
  <div class="bg-cream-soft h-[140%] w-[140%] -translate-x-1/3 -translate-y-1/3 rounded-full"></div>
</div>
